# Floating windows (decision 081): a card that opens as its own window while
# the island keeps showing its pill. Several at once, from several providers.

scenario: a click on the pill opens the window; the island keeps its pill
start timer window
click                               -> Compact windows=timer focused=timer front=timer expanded=none
click                               -> Compact windows=timer focused=timer   # again: to the front, nothing more
close-window timer                  -> Compact windows=none focused=none

scenario: the pill brings a window that lost the keys back to the front
start timer window
click
focus-window none                   -> windows=timer focused=none
click                               -> Compact windows=timer focused=timer front=timer

scenario: Esc closes the focused window, unless its provider said not to
start timer window
click
esc                                 -> Compact windows=none
start notes window=noesc
click
esc                                 -> windows=notes focused=notes
close-window notes                  -> windows=none

scenario: Esc with no window focused is the island's
start timer window
click
focus-window none
esc                                 -> Compact windows=timer

scenario: windows from several providers are open at once
start media by=music
start timer window by=clock
start notes window by=pad           -> top=notes
click                               -> windows=notes front=notes Split
promote timer
click                               -> windows=notes,timer front=timer focused=timer Split
focus-window notes                  -> focused=notes
focus-window gone                   -> focused=none          # not one of ours

scenario: a provider has at most windowsPerProvider; past that the island shows the card
start a window by=p
click
start b window by=p
click
start c window by=p
click                               -> windows=a,b,c
start d window by=p
click                               -> Expanded expanded=d windows=a,b,c
outside
start e window by=other
click                               -> Split windows=a,b,c,e

scenario: a tab of an activity that opens as a window opens the window
start timer window
start media
click                               -> Expanded expanded=media
switch timer                        -> Split windows=timer focused=timer expanded=none

scenario: from Home, the window opens and the island goes back to its pill
panel focus window
click                               -> expanded=home
tile focus                          -> Idle windows=focus expanded=none
esc                                 -> Idle windows=none     # the window had the keys
panel todo window
click
pin                                 -> stay=yes
tile todo                           -> Expanded expanded=home windows=todo   # pinned: Home stays (decision 046)

scenario: the window goes with its card, and stays for a dormant panel
panel focus window
start focus window
click                               -> windows=focus
end focus                           -> windows=focus         # the panel's dormant card
unpanel focus                       -> windows=none focused=none

scenario: the provider can close its window
start search window
click
close-card search                   -> windows=none

scenario: a window's question is its own, focused or not
start timer window
start media
promote timer
click
focus-window none
ask timer                           -> dialog=timer
promote media
click                               -> Expanded expanded=media dialog=timer
ask media                           -> dialog=media,timer
close-dialog                        -> dialog=timer          # the island had the keys
focus-window timer
close-dialog                        -> dialog=none Expanded  # taking the keys alone doesn't close the island's card

scenario: typing is in the window that has the keys, and its text waits when it loses them
start notes window
click
focus notes add
type hello                          -> draft=hello
focus-window none                   -> draft=none
focus notes add                     -> draft=none            # not the focused card
focus-window notes
focus notes add                     -> draft=hello           # kept (decision 050)

scenario: a window's toast goes by itself
start todo window
click
toast todo                          -> toast=todo
wait 4999                           -> toast=todo
wait 1                              -> toast=none windows=todo

scenario: a fullscreen app or a critical alert leaves windows open
start timer window
click
hide                                -> Hidden windows=timer
show
alert battery critical              -> Alert windows=timer

scenario: a resized window never goes below windowMinSize
start notes window
click                               -> size=notes:480x380
resize-window notes 600 500         -> size=notes:600x500
resize-window notes 100 100         -> size=notes:320x220

scenario: the activity shortcut brings its window to the front
start timer window
click
focus-window none
open-activity                       -> Compact windows=timer focused=timer
